              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sūtrīna, sūtrīnae — \"a cobbler's shop\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sūtor in sūtrīnā calceōs novōs facit. The cobbler makes new shoes in his shop."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "First declension, feminine: sūtrīna, sūtrīnae f., from sūtor 'shoemaker'."
            }
          ]
