            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pelliō vestem calidam facit. The furrier makes a warm garment."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Third declension, masculine: pelliō, pelliōnis m. He made and sold warm clothes of skins."
            }
